msgid ""
"Edit the menu structure as JSON. Each item can have: name, icon, command "
"(run through the shell) or action (a session action: lock, logout, leave, "
"switchUser, suspend, hibernate, reboot, shutdown), submenu (array of items), "
"or separator (true)."
msgstr ""
"Bewerk de menustructuur als JSON. Elk item kan hebben: name, icon, command "
"(uitgevoerd via de shell) of action (een sessieactie: lock, logout, leave, "
"switchUser, suspend, hibernate, reboot, shutdown), submenu (array van "
"items) of separator (true)."

